Third-party blocklist sources
=============================

The compiled domain list in blocklist.txt is derived from:

1. Peter Lowe's ad server list
   https://pgl.yoyo.org/adservers/
   Used with permission as stated by the author for blocking ads;
   please credit pgl.yoyo.org as the source for those entries.

2. StevenBlack/hosts
