   https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/

blocklist-core.txt (High Speed mode) is Peter Lowe's ad server list as
fetched on 2026-11-27 plus a short hand-picked set of major ad/analytics
hosts.

chromium_releases.json is Chrome's public milestone schedule from
https://chromiumdash.appspot.com, used offline by the security audit to date
the engine's security-patch level.

Superwebby ships a compiled set of hostnames (one domain per line) for
offline request interception. It is not a verbatim copy of the original
filter-list files. If you redistribute Superwebby, retain this NOTICE.
